 "title": "Sioux County Treasurer | Sioux County, Iowa",
 "text": "Sioux County Treasurer | Sioux County, Iowa\nSkip to content\nMenu Elected Officials Attorney – Legal Counsel, Criminal Prosecution, Juvenile Justice\nAuditor – Tax Rates & Levies, Budgets, Real Estate Transfers\nRecorder – Real Estate Records, Permits, Licenses\nTreasurer – Vehicle Registrations, Driver’s Licenses, Tax Statements\nSheriff – Law Enforcement, Jail, Comm Center\nClose\nDepartments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nLearn about TITLE VI\nRenew Drivers License\nPassport Application\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nRequest GIS Data\nPay my Taxes\nSearch Paid Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nFind election results\nRequest an Absentee Ballot\nClose\nMenu Departments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS – Geographic Information Systems\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nOnline Services Assessment Search\nGIS Website\nProperty Tax Payments\nMotor Vehicle Registration\nPublic Access to Local Government Budgets\nDriver’s License Appointments\nClose\nElections\nMinutes\nAbout\nContact\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nPay my Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nPast Election Results\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nClose\nWelcome to Sioux County Treasurer\nWelcome to the Sioux County Treasurer's web site. We hope this will provide you with information you need and make contacting us easier and more efficient. It is our goal to provide quality customer service to the residents of Sioux County through all our departments and be prudent and responsible in managing the financial assets of the county.\nDan Zomermaand * Term: 4 Years * Term Expires: 2026\nDrivers License: 712-737-8430 * Motor Vehicle: 712-737-2222 * Tax Dept: 712-737-3505 * Fax: 712-737-8170\n* Lobby Hours: 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. * Transactions processed until 4:00 p.m.\n* CLOSED every Tuesday morning from 8:00 a.m. - 9:00 a.m. for training *\nQuick Links\nMotor Vehicle\nMotor Vehicle\nProperty Tax Information\nProperty Tax Information\nProperty Tax Search\nProperty Tax Search\nPay Property Tax\nPay Property Tax\nDrivers License Schedule\nDrivers License Schedule\nDL Testing Information\nDL Testing Information\nContact Us\nContact Us\nTreasurer Information:\nThe collection of property taxes for real estate parcels, mobile homes, and special assessments. We respond to tax inquiries, administer the Iowa Property Tax Program, Elderly Tax Credit Program and conduct the annual tax sale for the collection of delinquent taxes. You can pay your taxes on line at www.iowatreasurers.org or click on “Pay Property Taxes\" above.\nThe financial administration, banking services, cash management and investments for the county . We manage $80 plus million per year in receipts, distribution of collections to schools, cities and all other taxing agencies.\nThe issuance of vehicle titles and registrations , and the collection of all vehicle fees for residents of Sioux County. We process vehicle transactions, respond to telephone inquiries, provide service to walk-in customers and collect fees. You can pay your motor vehicle fees on line at www.iowatreasurers.org\nDriver's Licenses and identification cards are issued by the Iowa Department of Transportation. Please visit their web page for service times and locations.\nFrequently Asked Questions:\nBill of Sale Form\nIowa Property Tax Credit Claim Form\nIowa Mobile Home Property Tax Credit Claim Form\nIowa Special Assessment Property Tax Credit Claim Form\nAffidavit for Redemption Form\nNotice to Tax Sale Purchasers 2026\nClick here for Buyer's Checklist\n210 Central Ave SW\nPO Box 18\nOrange City, IA 51041\n712-737-2216\n© 2026 Sioux County, Iowa • Website by Blue Lake Websites",
